  "prefLabel": "Bfc 203.02 Petition for Adopting Amendments to the State Fire Code",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfc 203.02 Petition for Adopting Amendments to the State Fire Code.\n\n(a) Any person may request the board and the state fire marshal to commence a proceeding for the purposes of amending the state fire code described in RSA 153:1, VI-a by completing and filing a petition on Form DSFM 140 (rev. 8/13).\n\nSource. #10553-B, eff 3-25-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bfc200.html"
